export anchor DarkEditorialStyle:
    number: 267
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Dark editorial
    idea: The folder is laid out like a magazine spread at night, with a serif masthead, a numbered index of files and the selected file run as the cover story.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #12100e, page, spread and style sheet
        paper: #1b1815, the cover frame
        cream: #efe7d8, headlines, body and outline buttons
        muted: #b5aa95, numerals, bylines, dek and labels
        rule: #3d362d, column rules and double masthead rules
        track: #2f2a24, storage and upload tracks
        vermilion: #f0805f, kicker, primary button, Starred mark, selected numeral, storage fill and focus
    type:
        Serif headings in Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype, Palatino,
        Book Antiqua, Georgia. The title is 80px at 400 with 0.95 leading,
        the cover title 32px, index entries 23px, folders 30px, the dek and
        sizes italic 17 to 20px. Labels and bylines use system-ui at 11 to
        12px caps tracked 0.1 to 0.16em.
    layout:
        A centred 1200px spread. The masthead has Brightwork Drive in serif
        with Drive in vermilion italic, the five places as caps section
        links with My files underlined, and an italic underline search,
        closed by a double rule. A hero has the breadcrumb as a vermilion
        caps kicker, the huge title and an italic dek, with Upload, New
        folder and a List or Grid caps switch at the right. Below, a seven
        to four split divided by a column rule. The left is The index, a
        numbered list 01 to 08 with big muted numerals, serif names, caps
        bylines of kind, date and person, and italic sizes, the two folders
        set larger. The right is Selected · cover story with a large
        drawn cover, the name, a dek, caps facts, the three buttons and a
        By the numbers box with 64.2 GB of 100 GB in big serif and a
        vermilion bar. Below 980px the columns stack. Below 760px the
        masthead stacks and the title drops to 52px.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 40px gutters and a 40px column gap split by a rule, 16px between entries, 48px above the title.
    density: Spacious and rhythmic. Eight numbered entries with the two folders set larger as features.
    corners: Square throughout.
    borders: 1px #3d362d rules between entries and columns, 4px double rules under the masthead and above the numbers box.
    shadows: None. The selected entry has a warm left fade and a vermilion numeral.
    icons:
        16px line icons used sparingly in buttons and marks. Status marks
        are caps words with a filled star for Starred in vermilion, two
        heads for Shared with 4 and an up arrow ring for Uploading 62%
        over a 3px rule bar.
    focus: A 2px vermilion outline with a 3px offset.
    tone: Editorial headings over plain facts, such as The index, Selected · cover story and 35.8 GB left on the shelf.
